---
title: RW_RTC_Init
---

flowchart TD
    A[Start RTC initialization] --> B{RTC already initialized?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Skip setup]
    C --> D[return]
    B -- No --> E[Initialize RTC peripheral]
    E --> F{Initialization successful?}
    F -- No --> G[Error_Handler]
    F -- Yes --> H[Load default startup time]
    H --> I[Store default time in RTC]
    I --> J[Mark RTC as initialized]
    J --> D
